<p><em>With our {{ getAge('2007-12-10') }} years of experience,</em> we offer <em>several courses</em> ranging from HTML5 / CSS3 to the development of complex applications with Symfony2.</p>

<span class="arrow">
    <img src="{{ asset('images/balise_left.svg') }}" alt="{% trans %}left arrow{% endtrans %}"/>
</span>

<h3 class="trainings">our different courses</h3>

<span class="arrow">
    <img src="{{ asset('images/balise_right.svg') }}" alt="{% trans %}right arrow{% endtrans %}"/>
</span>

<div class="courses">
    {% for course in app.config.courses %}
        <div>
            <a href="{{ path('courses', {'_locale': app.translator.locale}) }}"  class="tools-sprite {{ course }}">{{ course }}</a>
        </div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
